config GPIO_SC2720_EIC_UMS9117
	bool "SC2720 analog EIC on UMS9117"
	depends on ARCH_UMS9117
	depends on GPIOLIB
	select GPIOLIB_IRQCHIP
	help
	  Own the SC2720 analog interrupt aggregate and expose its EICA inputs
	  as a sleeping GPIO and nested interrupt controller through the UMS9117
	  ADI transport. Boards describe the qualified input lines and their
	  key mappings in Device Tree.
